WEBVTT

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:15.870
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:19.580
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:23.160
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:27.080
and spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:32.740
Kasel and his friends continue their travels
to unseal the Holy Sword Aea.

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:36.990
Two more locks remain on the seal.

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:41.870
They have arrived at Mount Ogria
to meet the Orc chief Aeatola,

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:44.410
who is said to hold one of the keys.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:48.740
That must be the Red Valley.

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:23.910
<i></i>Orcish

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:23.910
<i></i>Pride

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:38.370
What's so funny?

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:44.830
Can't you hear it? The rage,
sorrow, the wailing of the humans?

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.240
Nope.

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:49.580
I've waited a hundred years
for this next banquet.

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:52.080
Exciting, is it not?

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:55.910
The Dark Lord Angmund is the one
in charge of destroying the world.

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:59.290
You're just the sorcerer that brings him back.

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:05.160
My only desire is to watch
the poor silly humans' dance of death.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.330
Just like before!

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.080
Father, the weather is beautiful.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:18.490
And the air is very comforting.

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:29.080
He seems to be asleep most of the time.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:32.580
I believe the king himself asked the doctors

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:36.490
to give him stronger medication for the pain.

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:38.290
I see...

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:43.740
There is nothing to be worried about.
The king has our full support.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:54.660
As sorcerer for the Republic of Grey,
I delved into my research.

00:03:56.910 --> 00:03:59.700
I will be going to war soon.

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.950
But...

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:04.410
I promise I will return.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.160
So please, wait for me.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:13.330
I sometimes think of what life would be like
if I was not born as a royal.

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.620
About my father...

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:18.290
And about you, Theo.

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:19.700
Jane...

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.200
Malduk!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:29.240
A lowly knight, seducing the princess...

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:33.370
I intend to give up my life for this nation.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:39.120
Weak excuse. War is about
to start at any moment now.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:40.830
You scoundrel!

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:45.580
You also seem to exert
too much influence in domestic affairs.

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:50.160
Princess Jane, you must be wiser.

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:56.790
Father!

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:59.620
To pass away at such a critical time...

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:02.450
If our enemies find out, we're done for!

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:05.740
We don't even have a proper heir determined.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.990
What's going to happen to the Republic of Grey?!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.450
Bring father back with magic?!

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:20.120
Yes. After much research, we have finally
successfully created the forbidden magic.

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:25.450
Now is the time for me to show
my true power as a sorcerer.

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:31.040
My magic was a success.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:34.950
The king returned as an undead.

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:41.660
What is this?

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:43.580
I'm sending you into exile!

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:46.580
Why must I leave?

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:51.040
After all the hard work I did
to save this nation,

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:55.870
after all the research I did to finally
create such wonderful magic!

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:59.740
Lies! All you wanted was
a subject to experiment on!

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:02.990
I have brought the king back to life.

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:05.740
Bringing the dead back to life...

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:10.040
A noble accomplishment of epic proportions.

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:16.660
You should celebrate with me.
Nobody has ever successfully done this before.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:22.200
My name shall be known across
this entire nation... No, the world!

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:28.450
You defiled the king's death. You've fallen
lower than I thought possible, you devil!

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:33.740
I gave life to a corpse. I am not a devil.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.660
I am... God.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:43.830
You will never be allowed
to set foot in these lands again!

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:49.830
Rather than praise my magic, they instead
insulted me and threw me into exile.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:54.200
Fools...

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:56.950
One day, they will see Hell.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:01.330
The castles, the towns, the citizens,
this entire nation will pay...

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:04.240
...through horrifying death!

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:15.240
Maria! Let us enjoy this banquet,
100 years in the making!

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.830
I will help you bring the Dark Lord back.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:30.700
Eek, how scary.

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:36.330
Rumor says this red color is from
all the blood that got spilled in war.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:40.240
Who in their right minds would live
in such a place? Orcs have bad taste.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:45.410
Sounds like a tall tale, but it fits
the aggressive and war-loving Orcs.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:48.410
I can't believe anyone can love war.

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:51.240
There really are weird people
like that out there.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.950
Speaking of which...

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.580
Let's go.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:25.120
Master Kaulah!

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:32.830
Thank you, Dale.

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:35.910
Master Kaulah, why did you come here alone?

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.200
You nuisances!

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.620
Whoa, trouble!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.410
Orcs fighting each other!

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:46.660
No.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:48.580
Look carefully. They're undead.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.580
The Orcs have undead, too?!

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:56.740
Master Kaulah!

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:05.330
Humans?!

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:09.660
Step aside unless you want to get burned!

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:19.330
Scorched black, coming right up!

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:32.540
Thank you, you saved us.

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:33.090
Um...

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.160
Don't move!

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:38.450
Stop that, Dale.

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:41.870
We cannot allow humans
to enter Orc lands any more.

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:43.490
That is what the chief ordered.

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:47.330
Don't worry. I've been waiting for him.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:50.910
I knew three days ago that he was coming.

00:09:52.870 --> 00:09:54.290
I see.

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:58.450
Please excuse my apprentice
and his short temper.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:01.410
First, I'd like to spend
some time speaking with you.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:05.410
But before that, please give us a moment.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:09.580
I must ask the ancestral spirits for
their forgiveness for soiling this land.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:17.240
Oh, great ancestral spirits of the Orcs...

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:20.660
May you rest in eternal silence and peace...

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:33.240
Let's start over.

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:37.580
I am Kaulah, Orc shaman.

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:39.700
This is Dale.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.870
My name is Kasel.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.580
Brave champion, I have been waiting for you.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:45.830
Huh?

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:52.950
I occasionally receive messages from
the great ancestral spirits as dreams.

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:55.120
A prophetic dream, if you will.

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:56.830
I've heard about that.

00:10:56.830 --> 00:11:02.790
Orc shamans can lead their tribe
to a better future through dreams.

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:05.540
And Kasel was in one of your dreams?

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:09.870
Yes. A human hero will appear
in a chaotic future,

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:12.490
and bring hope to us all.

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:17.120
Who are you? Where did you come from?!

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:20.910
Hey, stop glaring at us like that.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.740
I'm sorry.

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:28.200
Dale, as a shaman, you must learn
to keep a calm mind and heart.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.410
Yes...

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:32.160
Yep. Chill.

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:37.080
We are here to meet Aeatola, the Orc Chief.

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:40.120
I need to unseal the Holy Sword.

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:43.830
Then are you the heir to the Holy Sword...?

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:45.870
Hah! Lies!

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:50.450
You're trying to exploit
Chief Aeatola's death to deceive us!

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:52.700
Chief Aeatola passed away?!

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:56.080
Yes. The current chief is Chief Sieg.

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:57.160
But...

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:59.580
We came all the way out here!

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:03.660
For matters regarding the Holy Sword,

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:08.080
Chief Sieg may have received
instructions from Chief Aeatola.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:10.990
Then please, let me meet Chief Sieg!

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:13.910
Impossible! Humans are
working with the Demons,

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:16.740
and therefore must never be
allowed to enter our lands.

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:20.700
Those are Chief Sieg's orders,
and the chief's orders cannot be questioned!

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:22.700
Working with the Demons?

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:24.370
What does that mean?

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:29.040
One day, a human calling himself
a sorcerer came to our valley.

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:33.410
At the same time, many of our
companions disappeared, mysteriously.

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:34.990
Afterwards...

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:42.870
They suddenly returned
as undead and attacked us.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:51.290
That human was working with
the Demons to turn us into undead!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:57.080
Please wait! Humans working
with Demons? That's impossible...

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:59.790
What was that sorcerer like?

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:04.370
I hear he had long hair, like a woman.

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:06.540
Does that sound familiar?

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:12.290
Well, many sorcerers are from the Tower
of the Sage, so I thought I might know.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:15.580
But I don't remember anyone
with that appearance.

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:16.310
What about you, Roi?

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.990
No, me neither.

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:21.950
Anyway, we have to unseal the Holy Sword.

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:23.490
There's no time left...

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:27.540
Please tell us where Chief Sieg is!

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:36.620
I understand, Mr. Kasel.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:39.990
I will escort you to the chief.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:44.540
If the chief decides to draw
his sword against you,

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:47.830
I will protect you with my life.

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:49.450
No, that's...

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:54.540
Master Kaulah! You must not
risk your life for some human!

00:13:54.540 --> 00:14:00.490
Protecting the heir to the Holy Sword
means protecting our own future.

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:04.700
Dale, have I ever misinterpreted a dream?

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:08.120
N-No, sir...

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:10.950
Mr. Kasel, please don't worry.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:15.700
We Orcs willingly
sacrifice our lives for a cause.

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:19.040
Mr. Kaulah, I'm honored, but...

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:22.910
I think first thing would just be
to talk to Chief Sieg, properly.

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:24.410
Of course.

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:28.450
However, I must ask that only Mr. Kasel
come to meet Chief Sieg.

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:30.790
I must ask your companions to wait here.

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:31.300
Huh?

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.910
Why?!

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:38.120
The others will be cautious
if I bring multiple humans.

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:40.160
I want to prevent a riot.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:42.910
Riot? Whoa...

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:47.040
Understood. We will wait for Kasel here.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:50.120
Watch your back, Kasel.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:51.410
Yeah.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:59.830
Kasel... I'm worried.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:02.910
I know, right? I hope he's okay.

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:06.490
Orcs seem to have a clear chain of command.

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:09.120
In other words, they're organized.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:12.200
It must be important for
a race that flaunts its strength.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:17.200
That means Chief Sieg controls our fate, right?

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:20.080
Yeah. I wonder how they'll play this...

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.450
Kasel...

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:24.790
Come on, don't be so glum, both of you.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:29.200
Look, look, see this pattern? If I do this...

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:30.950
See? A face!

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.790
Oh, Cleo...

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:37.490
I wonder what that is, though?
Looks like the tattoos the Orcs had.

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:39.580
Huh, I guess you're right.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.870
I wonder if it means anything?

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:45.410
I think Orc tattoos have
some shamanistic elements,

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:48.790
like warding off illness and injuries.

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:51.740
Passed along over generations
or something like that.

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:56.370
Hearing what Mr. Kaulah said,

00:15:56.370 --> 00:16:00.540
it sounded like Orcs put
a lot of value in invisible things.

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.990
That must be a precious
shamanistic thing, too.

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:04.240
I suppose so.

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:07.040
I should erase this before someone gets mad.

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:12.240
Hmm? It won't come off...

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.700
What are humans doing here?!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.410
Are you trying to take more
of our friends away?!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:23.240
Please wait! We were just here with Mr. Kaulah!

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:24.990
Master Kaulah?

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:30.160
It's true. He took one of our
companions to meet the chief.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:32.950
We can't trust humans!

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:37.200
I'm a sorcerer!

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:41.950
I'll never allow anyone who works
with Demons to call themselves a sorcerer.

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:44.330
Don't you worry! The moment I find that guy,

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:47.700
I'll beat him up with my magic!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:59.370
Um... Point is, we have
no intention of tricking you, so...

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.490
What is this?!

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:02.870
Uh-oh!

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.330
Ow!

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:16.080
A human! A human is here!

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:19.790
Kill him!

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:22.240
Rip him to shreds!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:39.740
Chief Sieg. A hero appears,
as I have informed you earlier.

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:44.080
This is Kasel. He claims to be
the heir to the Holy Sword.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:49.120
He is the only one who can defeat
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:51.370
Heir to the Holy Sword...?

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:56.540
Chief Sieg. We came here to meet Chief Aeatola.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:59.370
However, we were told that
Chief Aeatola already passed away.

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:03.620
Chief Aeatola had the key
to unsealing the Holy Sword.

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:05.370
Do you know about this?

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:09.910
Where is the proof that
you are indeed the heir?

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:11.740
Proof...?

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:16.990
If you are the heir, your swordsmanship
must be impressive as well.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.330
Defeat me!

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.990
Please, wait!

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:35.990
This hero must survive, to save the world.

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:43.950
If anyone seeks to hurt or kill him,
I will sacrifice my life to protect him!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:58.620
Then you die first!

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:00.540
Please wait, Chief Sieg!

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:08.910
Is that the Orc way, to subjugate by force?

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:14.040
Demons are loose. We must unite.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.120
Any who disrupt our unity must die.

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:20.910
That brings us safety in the future.

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:24.490
Isn't the future something
you build together with your friends?!

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:27.790
Shouldn't those who lead do
everything they can to protect everyone?!

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:39.910
Immature! A small sacrifice
must be made to save the many.

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:42.830
Otherwise, we march to our doom.

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:47.160
That's... No! That's wrong!

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:50.450
There's no justification for sacrifice!

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:53.040
Then how would you protect?

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:59.410
I will protect everyone,
using my body as a shield, if I must!

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:06.240
Hah! How many lives can you
hope to save with such a thin body?

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:15.370
Your body as a shield, you said?

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:21.040
I don't care what happens to me.

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:23.740
I just want to protect everyone!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:28.790
Conviction without power is worthless!

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:44.620
You are like us.

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:48.830
You have something
more valuable than your life.

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:53.490
Chief Aeatola did leave a message.

00:20:53.490 --> 00:20:56.790
If someone arrives claiming to be
the heir to the Holy Sword,

00:20:56.790 --> 00:21:00.200
they must be taken to the Holy Shrine.

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:02.290
Holy Shrine...?

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:07.240
Chief Aeatola left something there.
You must bring that back.

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:08.120
Huh?

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:13.330
The Holy Shrine is the place where
our ancestral spirits are enshrined.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:17.700
It is the source of wisdom
and power for all Orcs,

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:22.040
and tests those who visit it.

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:27.080
But only a few have ever overcome
the test and returned...

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:31.660
There, we shall find out
if you truly are the heir.

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:37.740
Chief Sieg, we have captured humans
who defiled the Holy Fountain.

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:39.950
Hey.

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:43.410
Kasel, it's not what you think.
I didn't defile the fountain,

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:46.660
it was just a badly timed
misunderstanding that, uh...

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:48.910
As always, Cleo messed up.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:52.700
They will be held as hostage.

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:57.290
If the ancestral spirits determine that
you are not the heir to the Holy Sword,

00:21:57.290 --> 00:22:01.540
you will die, and then, of course, they will.

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:05.870
Uhh...

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:08.870
Kaulah, you take him.

00:22:08.870 --> 00:22:10.080
Yes.

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:14.040
Kasel!

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:53.990
Kasel enters the Holy Shrine to prove
that he is the heir to the Holy Sword.

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:56.410
What is the test that awaits him there?

00:23:57.660 --> 00:24:00.870
Please return safely, Kasel.

00:23:58.240 --> 00:24:00.910
<i></i>The Time

00:23:58.240 --> 00:24:00.910
<i></i>for Trial
